R3 is **not solid**. It restores the multi-family framing, but the presentation fragment, family completion and several qualification contracts remain incomplete.

The supplied SHA-256 matches both the frozen file and DS `f6f3ba37`. The delta reconstructs r3 exactly. Node reproduced all four G0 vectors—**186/206/86/320 bytes**—with matching digests. Checked source hashes match; the shared corpus’s 198 pinned files, three Unicode files and 69 F1 parity files also verify. No files were edited.

